    "published_atlas_discrepancy": "Filippov Supplementary Table 1 labels F60/M60 in GSE213516 and PB00015/PB00566 in GSE214546 as old despite the prose >60 rule. The public create_adatas.py code skips old samples only when age <60, so the actual atlas includes age 60. Strict >60 is primary here; age>=60 is a labeled atlas-reproduction sensitivity.",
