  "GSE214546": {
    "citation": "Thomson et al. Trimodal single-cell profiling reveals a novel pediatric CD8alphaalpha+ T cell subset and broad age-related molecular reprogramming across the T cell compartment. Nature Immunology 24, 1947-1959 (2023).",
